{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>In order to elevate you.</b> To exalt you in the world — that a name go forth for you among the nations, that it is in His glory that He revealed Himself to you." "<b>Elevate.</b> A term of raising and greatness, as in ״הָרִימוּ נֵס״ (Isaiah 62), ״אָרִים נִסִּי״ (ibid. 49), ״כַּנֵּס עַל הַגִּבְעָה״ (ibid. 30) — that which is upright." "<b>And in order that His fear be.</b> Through your having seen Him as fearful and awesome, you shall know that there is none besides Him, and you shall fear Him."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:53:19.272380247Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}